OL,3,GNEWSAJamie Oliver saves flight school
OL,4,Athat trained him
OL,5,
OL,6,FJamie Oliver has stepped in to save the
OL,7,Fairfield and flying school where he
OL,8,Ftrained to be a pilot.
OL,10,FThe owners at Andrewsfield Aviation,
OL,11,Fnear Braintree in Essex, said they were
OL,12,Fpreparing to close operations because
OL,13,Fthere was no successor lined up after
OL,14,Fthey retired.
OL,16,FBut the TV chef, who achieved his pilot
OL,17,Flicence in July, helped arrange new
OL,18,Fownership to ensure the hangar doors
OL,19,Fremained open.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
